  "project_description": "The webdev module bundles contributed tools commonly used across Drupal site builds. It provides foundational functionality while also configuring the UI Suite and Display Builder for creating displays, layouts, and pages with components.\n\n Included modules:\n\n Site building basics: Ctools, Token, Pathauto, Metatag, Field Group, Diff.\n Content tools: Smart Trim, Entity Queue, Inline Entity Form, Better Exposed Filters, Link Attributes, Token Filter.\n Development utilities: Shield, Devel, User Redirect, Autocomplete Deluxe, Default Content.\n UI Suite components: UI Patterns 2, UI Styles, UI Icons, UI Skins.\n Additional feature: Display Builder with default profile and HTML text format support.",
